### BUILD AN INTERACTIVE PRICING CALCULATOR

Create a premium interactive quantity selector.

The user should be able to:

- Increase card quantity.
- Decrease card quantity.
- Enter a custom quantity.
- See the applicable discount automatically.
- See the original card price.
- See the discounted one-time card total.
- See the monthly recurring subscription.
- See the combined first-month payment.

Pricing formulas:

Original one-time price = Quantity × 1,200 BDT.

Discount:
- Quantity = 1: 0%.
- Quantity = 2–5: 15%.
- Quantity ≥ 6: 20%.

Discounted one-time price = Original one-time price × (1 − discount rate).

Monthly recurring payment = Quantity × 200 BDT.

First-month total = Discounted one-time price + Monthly recurring payment.

IMPORTANT: Display the monthly recurring payment separately from the one-time purchase.

